id: jetpack
name: Jetpack
kind: gear
itemType: accessory
tags: tech
craftDC: Qualified
# "A Jetpack has a Ki Point Pool of 30(bT), based on the creator's Tier of Power at the time
# of creation." Worked out off the character it is given to, when it is given; editable on
# the Item, where a Jetpack made by somebody else can be set to theirs.
chargesPerBaseTier: 30
chargesLabel: Ki
# "When you would spend Ki Points through the Movement Maneuver, remove them from the
# Jetpack instead."
paysMovement: true
# "You gain access to the Soar Maneuver."
grantsManeuver: soar
source: Core Rule
description: >
  30(bT) Ki that pays for Movement instead of yours, and the Soar Maneuver, while worn.
text: >
  Jetpack [Tech]: This is a wearable device that allows flight to characters who cannot
  otherwise fly.
  –Craft DC: Qualified
  –Effects: A Jetpack has a Ki Point Pool of 30(bT), based on the creator’s Tier of Power at
  the time of creation. When you would spend Ki Points through the Movement Maneuver, remove
  them from the Jetpack instead. You gain access to the Soar Maneuver.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Given: its pool, 30 per base Tier of Power of the character it is given to.
#
# While worn, a Movement's Ki - Boosted Speed, Rapid Movement - comes out of the pool. What
# the pool cannot cover the character pays, by the table's ruling, and only that part counts
# against their Capacity: the Jetpack's Ki never does. A Blockade that wins hands each part
# back to where it came from, the pool never past what it was made with.
#
# Soar is opened while it is worn, the way a Skill would open it.
#
# --- What the table keeps ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Refilling it: the entry says nothing of it, so the count is edited on the Item.
